---
/* L14 - argmax: the ranking survives every scale change. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L14.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of a scoreboard wall in two rows, each row carrying three unmarked raised blocks of decreasing height, with a stagehand's long pointer touching the tallest block in the upper row while the lower row's tallest block stands in the same position."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L14-fig-title L14-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L14-fig-title">The ranking survives every change of scale</title>
      <desc id="L14-fig-desc">
        Across the top, four boxes are joined by arrows: logits, scaled logits,
        probabilities and a label, with the steps divide by T, softmax and
        argmax written above the arrows. Below, the raw scores 8, 5 and 4 are
        listed in rank order on the left and repeated in the same order on the
        right, joined by two arrows labelled multiply every logit by 3 and add
        100 to every logit. On the far right, a note says that argmax returns
        a position and not a value, and that a tie goes to the lower index.
      </desc>

      <defs>
        <marker id="L14-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--color-ink-45)" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="L14-arrow-prussian" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- the chain -->
      <text x="181" y="44" class="fig-text fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">÷ T</text>
      <text x="341" y="44" class="fig-text fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">softmax</text>
      <text x="501" y="44" class="fig-text fig-text--dim" text-anchor="middle">argmax</text>

      <rect x="40" y="50" width="125" height="58" class="fig-box" />
      <text x="52" y="74" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">logits</text>
      <text x="52" y="94" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">raw scores</text>

      <path d="M 167 79 L 196 79" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L14-arrow)" />

      <rect x="200" y="50" width="125" height="58" class="fig-box" />
      <text x="212" y="74" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">scaled logits</text>
      <text x="212" y="94" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">z / T</text>

      <path d="M 327 79 L 356 79" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L14-arrow)" />

      <rect x="360" y="50" width="125" height="58" class="fig-box" />
      <text x="372" y="74" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">probabilities</text>
      <text x="372" y="94" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">sum to 1</text>

      <path d="M 487 79 L 516 79" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L14-arrow)" />

      <rect x="520" y="50" width="85" height="58" class="fig-box" />
      <text x="532" y="74" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">label</text>
      <text x="532" y="94" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">top position</text>

      <!-- the ranking, before and after -->
      <text x="40" y="160" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">the raw scores</text>
      <text x="320" y="160" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">the same order</text>

      <text x="40" y="192" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">1</text>
      <text x="76" y="192" class="fig-text fig-text--num" fill="var(--color-prussian)">8</text>
      <text x="40" y="227" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">2</text>
      <text x="76" y="227" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink">5</text>
      <text x="40" y="262" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">3</text>
      <text x="76" y="262" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink">4</text>

      <text x="150" y="180" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">× 3 on every logit</text>
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 145; --m-duration: 1.2s;" d="M 150 192 L 290 192" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L14-arrow-prussian)" />

      <text x="150" y="250" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">+ 100 on every logit</text>
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 145; --m-duration: 1.2s; --m-delay: 0.35s;" d="M 150 262 L 290 262" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L14-arrow-prussian)" />

      <text x="320" y="192" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">1</text>
      <text x="356" y="192" class="fig-text fig-text--num" fill="var(--color-prussian)">8</text>
      <text x="320" y="227" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">2</text>
      <text x="356" y="227" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink">5</text>
      <text x="320" y="262" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">3</text>
      <text x="356" y="262" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--ink">4</text>

      <!-- what argmax actually gives you -->
      <text x="456" y="180" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">argmax returns a position</text>
      <text x="456" y="198" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">not a value - a position</text>
      <text x="456" y="228" class="fig-text fig-text--ink">ties go to the lower index</text>
      <text x="456" y="246" class="fig-text fig-text--num fig-text--dim">argmax([1.0, 3.0, 3.0]) is 1</text>

      <text x="40" y="300" class="fig-text fig-text--dim">multiplying every logit by 3 sharpens the probabilities; adding 100 changes nothing at all</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L14</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">Multiplying every logit by 3 or adding 100 to all of them leaves the ranking unchanged, so argmax keeps returning the same position.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--color-ink-70);
  }

  .fig-text--ink {
    fill: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .fig-text--dim {
    fill: var(--color-ink-45);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .fig-text--num {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .fig-box {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
</style>
